1
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:05,420
Filters show only the rows you want. Click Filters.

2
00:00:05,520 --> 00:00:09,280
A filter box appears under each column.

3
00:00:09,380 --> 00:00:12,810
Number columns, like Open price, get a range filter.

4
00:00:12,910 --> 00:00:15,440
Choose greater than, less than, equal or between, and type a value.

5
00:00:15,540 --> 00:00:19,560
Click Ok.

6
00:00:19,660 --> 00:00:23,980
No trade opened at 2 or higher, so the table is now empty.

7
00:00:24,080 --> 00:00:28,650
The cross on Filters clears every filter, and the rows come back.

8
00:00:28,750 --> 00:00:36,350
Text columns, like Account, match any text you type.

9
00:00:36,450 --> 00:00:43,290
Date columns offer Current Day, Current Shift, or a From and Till range.

10
00:00:43,390 --> 00:00:46,790
Filters on different columns work together. A row must match all of them.

